msgid ""
"Report invoiced revenue for the last 6 full calendar months (exclude the current partial month).\n"
"\n"
"Scope: posted customer invoices (`account.move`, type `out_invoice`, state `posted`), minus credit notes (`out_refund`).\n"
"\n"
"Per month table:\n"
"- Month (YYYY-MM)\n"
"- Total invoiced (untaxed and tax-included)\n"
"- Number of invoices\n"
"- Top 3 customers contributing and their share\n"
"- Month-over-month % change on the tax-excluded total\n"
"\n"
"End with:\n"
"- 6-month total (untaxed and tax-included)\n"
"- Average monthly revenue\n"
"- Use the default company currency; do not convert."
msgstr ""
"Berichten Sie den fakturierten Umsatz der letzten 6 vollen Kalendermonate (ohne den aktuellen angebrochenen Monat).\n"
"\n"
"Umfang: gebuchte Kundenrechnungen (`account.move`, Typ `out_invoice`, Status `posted`), abzüglich Gutschriften (`out_refund`).\n"
"\n"
"Tabelle pro Monat:\n"
